OL,3,ARescuers dig through Ukraine mall
OL,4,Awreckage as Zelensky condemns
OL,5,A'despicable' strike
OL,6,
OL,7,FRescuers in Ukraine worked through the
OL,8,Fnight to search for survivors in the
OL,9,Fwreckage of a shopping centre hit by a
OL,10,Fdeadly Russian double-tap drone strike.
OL,12,FSixteen people were killed and 130
OL,13,Finjured in the busy mall in Kryvyi Rih
OL,14,Fon Friday, local officials said. Nine
OL,15,Fpeople are reportedly still missing,
OL,16,Fincluding two children.
OL,18,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said the
OL,19,F"cynical and despicable" attack was
OL,20,Fcarried out in two waves, with the
OL,21,Fsecond strike targeting emergency
OL,22,Fworkers at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
