OL,3,ARescuers dig through Ukraine mall
OL,4,Awreckage as Zelensky condemns
OL,5,A'despicable' strike
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoth sides meanwhile continued to trade
OL,8,Fstrikes overnight, with Ukrainian
OL,9,Fattacks said to have killed at least
OL,10,Ffour people in Russia, including two
OL,11,Fchildren, and two people reported dead
OL,12,Fby Kyiv.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
